<title>SWEDEN: Average rate in Swedish bond auction 6.28 pct.</title>
<headline>Average rate in Swedish bond auction 6.28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of two billion crowns of five-year bonds was 6.28 percent, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>						Loan 1039</p>
<p> Volume issued (billions)	     2.0</p>
<p> Total bids    (billions)	     7.52</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		3</p>
<p> Number of bids			  62</p>
<p> Lowest yields			    6.275</p>
<p> Highest yields			   6.275</p>
<p> Weighted average yield		 6.275</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
